      "id": "CHG-HYBRID-003",
      "rationale": "Implementation qualification found that rebuilding the current checkpoint otherwise generated a different checkpoint-ledger identity and omitted the corresponding export-ledger row. Adding the canonical checkpoint path and two UUIDv4 ledger IDs to the digest-bound envelope preserves schema-v1 authority while making fresh logical recovery exact.",
